# A chamfer's edges changed on its screen (ROADMAP F7): two top edges
# of the extrusion of path_extrude chamfered, as in ext_chamfer;
# [remove] on the second edge's row leaves the first alone; [change]
# with nothing selected activates the extrusion and says what to
# select; with the second edge picked, [change] cuts it instead. Check
# Solid finds each sound.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
click-entity 80030004
click-entity 8003001f
menu Features|Chamfer Edges
tw
twmove 492 225
twdown L 492 225
twup L 492 225
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
answer ok
twmove 96 165
twdown L 96 165
twup L 96 165
click-entity 8003001f
twmove 96 165
twdown L 96 165
twup L 96 165
tw
twmove 330 75
twdown L 330 75
twup L 330 75
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
